  <!-- EN: OCC grenade belt -->
  <OCC_GrenadeBelt.label>OCC手榴弹腰带</OCC_GrenadeBelt.label>
  <!-- EN: A grenade belt loaded with explosives that deal powerful Blast damage on explode. They can be thrown a short distance, where they'll explode, damaging anything and anyone nearby. Designed and modified for use by OCC Paladins.\n\nCan be reloaded using Obsidia Ammo Kit. -->
  <OCC_GrenadeBelt.description>装满爆炸物的手榴弹腰带，在爆炸时造成强大的冲击伤害。它们可以投掷到短距离，在那里爆炸，损坏附近的任何东西和任何人。专为OCC圣骑士设计和改装。\n\n可以使用黑曜石弹药包重新装填。</OCC_GrenadeBelt.description>
  <!-- EN: grenade -->
  <OCC_GrenadeBelt.comps.CompApparelReloadable.chargeNoun>手榴弹</OCC_GrenadeBelt.comps.CompApparelReloadable.chargeNoun>
  <!-- EN: on cooldown -->
  <OCC_GrenadeBelt.comps.CompApparelReloadable.cooldownGerund>冷却中</OCC_GrenadeBelt.comps.CompApparelReloadable.cooldownGerund>
